<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Belgaum | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it take to transport a bike from Bangalore to Belgaum?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our dedicated two‑wheeler fleet typically completes the Bangalore‑to‑Belgaum route in 24‑48 hours, thanks to optimized highway corridors and real‑time dispatch coordination. We guarantee door‑to‑door service within this window, barring extreme weather or unforeseen traffic disruptions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike fully insured during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every bike shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance policy that protects the declared value of your vehicle. In the unlikely event of damage, the insurance will fully compensate, and we also offer a zero‑scratch guarantee backed by our 7‑layer foam wrapping.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What kind of packaging do you use for two‑wheelers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a proprietary 7‑layer shock‑absorbent system: heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate components. This multi‑layer approach eliminates scratches, dents, and vibrations during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike’s location in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each container is equipped with a satellite GPS unit and 24/7 CCTV monitoring. Customers receive live tracking links via SMS or email, allowing you to watch the bike’s exact position from the moment it leaves Bangalore until it arrives in Belgaum.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the price for bike transport calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our transparent pricing includes base freight, fuel surcharge, handling fees, GST, and full‑coverage insurance. There are no hidden costs; the quote you receive reflects the total amount payable. We break down each component on the invoice for complete clarity.</p>
      </div>
